<title>FRANCE: Labinal wins Daimler contract.</title>
<headline>Labinal wins Daimler contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labinal said in a financial advertisement on Wednesday that it would supply electrical systems to Daimler Benz Aerospace Airbus Gmbh for Airbus planes.</p>
<p>It said the contract represented 100 million francs annually in the medium term. Deliveries are due to begin in the first half of 1997.</p>
</text>
